{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#card-card-zh","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-svn-tools 为 DeepSeek Harness 提供 Subversion 版本控制工具和 SVN 侧栏面板。插件向 agent 注册 svn_* 工具，并把面板接入 DSH 内置右侧栏或 dsh-better-sidebar。用户可以查看工作副本状态、差异和提交历史，执行更新与提交，也能在面板中浏览多工作副本并比较修订。历史可使用本地缓存离线查看，设置还可切换侧栏载体、默认页面及提交前的文件整理行为。适合需要让 DSH agent 或用户管理 SVN 工作副本的开发场景；需要本机可用的 svn 命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3578-3606","lib/client.js:1860-1875","lib/index.js:1911-1959"]}
{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#card-card-en","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-svn-tools adds SVN tools and a sidebar panel to DeepSeek Harness. Agents can inspect status, diffs, and history, update working copies, and commit changes. The panel supports revision comparison and cached offline history. A local svn executable is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3578-3606","lib/client.js:1860-1875","lib/index.js:1911-1959"]}
