{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#feature-feature-status","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-svn-tools 的功能「工作副本状态」：插件提供 `svn_status` 工具，默认检查当前会话工作区，也可指定路径；结果列出修改、添加、删除、冲突、未版本化等状态。侧栏也展示所选工作副本的状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3606-3620","lib/client.js:380","lib/client.js:1860-1875"]}
{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#feature-feature-diff","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-svn-tools 的功能「查看差异」：通过 `svn_diff` 查看本地修改的统一 diff，或指定修订范围比较版本；面板提供文件差异浏览和左右版本对比。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3633-3646","lib/client.js:744"]}
{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#feature-feature-history","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-svn-tools 的功能「提交历史」：`svn_log` 返回目标路径最近的提交记录，可包含作者、日期、消息及变更路径；面板还提供历史浏览，并可使用本地历史缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3647-3664","lib/index.js:1911-1959","lib/client.js:442"]}
{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#feature-feature-commit","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-svn-tools 的功能「更新与提交」：agent 可调用 `svn_update` 更新工作副本，并用 `svn_commit` 提交指定路径或全部更改；提交日志通过 UTF-8 文件传递，支持中文内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:3695-3740"]}
{"unit_id":"zengweicheng666__dsh-svn-tools#feature-feature-sidebar","repo":"zengweicheng666/dsh-svn-tools","commit":"b6c6973552d83d7c89fa41f8183bcc28005e7331","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-svn-tools 的功能「侧栏管理面板」：客户端将 SVN 面板注册到 DSH 内置右侧栏或 dsh-better-sidebar，显示工作副本状态、差异、提交和历史界面；设置可选择载体。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1860-1875","lib/index.js:3578-3605"]}
